WEBVTT

00:37.449 --> 00:39.177
[Episode 5]

00:39.177 --> 00:43.088
No matter how I think about it,
there's only one way out.

00:43.088 --> 00:44.390
[Where is the regional growth you promised?]

00:44.390 --> 00:46.133
That prosecutor

00:46.760 --> 00:47.784
must die.

00:47.784 --> 00:49.187
Boss!

00:49.187 --> 00:52.521
Even so, messing with a prosecutor
will make this way too big.

00:52.521 --> 00:53.689
- Jeez...
- Kang Sik, stop talking

00:53.689 --> 00:56.108
- I knew she'd really cause some trouble.
- and set up your best guys.

00:56.108 --> 00:59.018
Watch the timing and handle it properly.

01:13.800 --> 01:16.232
Yes, she has arrived.

01:16.232 --> 01:17.921
She just went into
Hillside Cafe in Nakwon-ri.

01:17.921 --> 01:20.081
Hillside Cafe?

01:27.014 --> 01:29.257
Answer the phone.

01:32.424 --> 01:34.046
Crap.

01:58.712 --> 02:01.205
I'm really going crazy, jeez.

02:14.408 --> 02:17.000
Taxi, taxi!

02:17.000 --> 02:18.598
Sir!

02:27.240 --> 02:30.202
The ferry incident,
Chief Kwon Sun Bok incident,

02:30.202 --> 02:33.448
and even the Samwol Villas suicide case...

02:33.448 --> 02:37.209
Han Kyung Wook and Yoo In Goo
are definitely connected.

02:37.209 --> 02:40.462
I was on that ferry in the espionage case

02:40.462 --> 02:42.673
ten years ago.

02:42.673 --> 02:44.216
I'm fully aware of the full details

02:44.216 --> 02:46.843
of the case you're investigating, Prosecutor.

02:46.843 --> 02:51.422
Can Kang Beom Ryong finally piece together
this puzzle of mysteries?

03:13.928 --> 03:16.447
Get her out of here.

03:28.328 --> 03:29.640
Prosecutor Kang.

03:29.640 --> 03:31.596
I remembered the answer

03:31.596 --> 03:33.974
to the question you asked me before.

03:33.974 --> 03:35.434
Do you have a minute?

03:35.434 --> 03:39.688
Oh, I see.

03:39.688 --> 03:42.088
Yes, please, have a seat.

03:42.088 --> 03:44.943
It's a bit noisy to talk here.

03:44.943 --> 03:46.853
Let's talk somewhere else.

03:52.325 --> 03:54.026
Huh?

04:14.473 --> 04:15.724
Hey! Get her!

04:15.724 --> 04:18.050
Catch her!

04:22.939 --> 04:24.149
Open the door!

04:24.149 --> 04:25.933
[Hillside Cafe]
Open it!

04:41.096 --> 04:43.585
Come on! How could you let her get away?

04:43.585 --> 04:45.640
What is it, why did you call?
And with a regular phone?

04:45.640 --> 04:46.797
Ho Myung.

04:46.797 --> 04:48.673
It's an emergency! Get over here right now.

04:48.673 --> 04:51.927
What are you talking about? I can't.
I'm here watching a show with my family now.

04:51.927 --> 04:56.328
The Yoo In Goo gang
is going to take out Prosecutor Kang.

04:56.328 --> 04:58.856
What? Seong Wo, where are you now?

04:58.856 --> 04:59.912
I'm on Yeongseondo Island.

04:59.912 --> 05:01.768
Prosecutor Kang is
on Yeongseondo Island right now?

05:01.768 --> 05:03.188
Yeah.

05:03.188 --> 05:06.696
Prosecutor Kang provoked Yoo In Goo,

05:06.696 --> 05:08.443
but this crazy guy...

05:08.443 --> 05:09.736
There's no time to explain now.

05:09.736 --> 05:12.489
Get over here quickly, hurry!

05:12.489 --> 05:14.024
I'm going crazy.

05:14.024 --> 05:17.416
If you do nothing,
Prosecutor Kang is going to die, man.

05:19.272 --> 05:22.281
If anything happens
to Prosecutor Kang, it's all over.

05:38.600 --> 05:40.550
Darn it.

05:46.792 --> 05:47.944
Darn it.

05:47.944 --> 05:49.725
- Ram it. Ram it.
- Pardon?

05:51.560 --> 05:52.616
No.

05:52.616 --> 05:54.730
- Why aren't you hitting it?
- Once more.

05:56.533 --> 05:58.609
Hit it, you punk!

06:00.264 --> 06:03.489
What are you doing, you punk? Chase her!

06:17.929 --> 06:19.630
Why isn't she stopping?

06:26.187 --> 06:28.744
Darn it.

06:34.344 --> 06:36.296
That way.

06:36.296 --> 06:38.024
You can't get past that?

06:38.024 --> 06:41.193
Oh, seriously, come on.

06:59.080 --> 07:00.755
Ram it! Ram it!

07:04.184 --> 07:06.061
- Harder, harder.
- Harder?

07:06.061 --> 07:08.095
Ram it!

07:10.216 --> 07:11.720
Oh, no.

07:14.728 --> 07:15.971
Darn it!

08:04.124 --> 08:05.431
Hurry!

08:06.663 --> 08:08.623
What?

08:08.623 --> 08:10.408
What the heck?

08:28.776 --> 08:34.941
[You can leave here dead, but not alive]

08:34.941 --> 08:37.143
Thank you!

08:46.984 --> 08:49.928
[You can leave here dead, but not alive]

09:20.361 --> 09:22.062
Oh, that startled me!

09:23.573 --> 09:27.827
Ghost, ghost! Uncle, Uncle...

09:27.827 --> 09:30.792
Ghost! Ghost! I saw a ghost! A maiden ghost!

09:30.792 --> 09:33.625
Why are you so jumpy?

09:33.625 --> 09:36.702
What kind of job could there be
in a place like this?

09:37.420 --> 09:41.091
She's taking us there to sell us off.

09:41.091 --> 09:43.218
I can hear you.

09:43.218 --> 09:46.513
This place used to be packed with people.

09:46.513 --> 09:48.807
Not anymore, since everyone got driven out.

09:48.807 --> 09:50.549
Why were they driven out?

09:51.272 --> 09:53.135
We're almost there.

09:54.562 --> 09:56.360
Come quickly.

09:56.360 --> 09:58.004
Jeez, seriously...

10:02.248 --> 10:04.239
They stormed in trying to grab a woman

10:04.239 --> 10:06.600
and caused a total mess.

10:06.600 --> 10:08.136
Jeez.

10:09.000 --> 10:10.696
Where did they all go?

10:10.696 --> 10:13.498
I don't know. They drove away quickly.

10:13.498 --> 10:14.728
Which direction?

10:14.728 --> 10:16.992
They went towards the main road.

10:32.424 --> 10:34.376
Why is Jeong Ho Myung here?

10:34.376 --> 10:38.148
Why did that punk, Kang Beom Ryong,
suddenly show up now of all times?

10:38.148 --> 10:40.650
Looks like he was searching
for some gangsters and a woman.

10:40.650 --> 10:42.360
Is the woman Prosecutor Kang?

10:42.360 --> 10:44.863
Has Ma Gong Bok changed his mind already?

10:44.863 --> 10:47.949
Then he must be here
to meet Prosecutor Kang too.

10:47.949 --> 10:51.536
Either way, now isn't the time
to worry about Kang Beom Ryong.

10:51.536 --> 10:52.954
Prosecutor Kang comes first.

10:52.954 --> 10:55.415
Anyway, there's no way he knows who I am.

10:55.415 --> 10:57.041
- Anyway...
- Anyway...

10:57.041 --> 10:59.493
- just act natural.
- just act natural.

11:25.361 --> 11:28.040
You little punk, what are you doing here?

11:28.040 --> 11:29.576
This isn't a coincidence, is it?

11:29.576 --> 11:32.327
Do you know who I am?

11:32.327 --> 11:33.672
What kind of trick is this?

11:33.672 --> 11:36.405
Tell me how you found out.

11:37.373 --> 11:40.293
Do you not know, or are you just pretending?

11:40.293 --> 11:44.756
Either way, I don't have time
for this, so move.

11:44.756 --> 11:47.759
The woman you were looking for
is Prosecutor Kang, right?

11:47.759 --> 11:50.377
Spit it out. What's happening?

11:54.312 --> 11:58.177
That prosecutor's in danger right now.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.779
What?

12:17.538 --> 12:19.944
You're tracking Prosecutor Kang, aren't you?

12:19.944 --> 12:22.168
I need to meet Prosecutor Kang too.
Let's go together.

12:22.168 --> 12:23.336
What?

12:23.336 --> 12:25.338
Are you crazy? Get off!

12:25.338 --> 12:27.840
You think I'm doing this because I want to?

12:27.840 --> 12:29.717
If I'd brought my car, I'd have...

12:29.717 --> 12:30.792
You think I'm driving a taxi?

12:30.792 --> 12:32.178
I'll pay you extra for the fare.

12:32.178 --> 12:35.431
You don't even know
where Prosecutor Kang went.

12:35.431 --> 12:37.850
You talk like you know something?

12:37.850 --> 12:39.593
Hold on.

12:40.200 --> 12:42.763
[CCTV]
Where exactly did he go?

12:47.151 --> 12:48.852
Boss?

12:51.322 --> 12:53.324
- Yeah, boss.
- Oh, Gong Bok.

12:53.324 --> 12:54.951
You can pull the CCTV footage
right now, can't you?

12:54.951 --> 12:56.578
All of a sudden? I mean...

12:56.578 --> 12:59.289
Where... where exactly?

12:59.289 --> 13:00.832
Hillside Cafe in Nakwon-ri.

13:00.832 --> 13:02.583
Pull the footage from about 30 minutes ago.

13:02.583 --> 13:04.904
You'll see suspicious vehicles
leaving the parking lot.

13:04.904 --> 13:07.797
- Vehicles?
- Track their route and get back to me quick.

13:07.797 --> 13:09.064
But is something going on?

13:09.064 --> 13:11.801
There's no time to explain.
Just text it to me.

13:11.801 --> 13:13.502
Um, wait...

13:15.720 --> 13:17.423
I'm already swamped.

13:19.432 --> 13:20.808
[CCTV]

13:27.726 --> 13:29.013
Alright.

13:33.990 --> 13:35.691
Come on in.

13:37.243 --> 13:38.944
Aren't you coming in?

13:42.123 --> 13:44.283
Come on, please come in, quickly.

13:53.896 --> 13:55.711
Hold on.

14:09.650 --> 14:11.477
Come up.

14:16.199 --> 14:19.035
This place used to
have a supermarket on the first floor.

14:19.035 --> 14:21.737
And the second floor was a study dorm.

14:35.688 --> 14:37.503
Why is he staring like that?

14:44.904 --> 14:46.312
Oh, okay.

14:46.984 --> 14:48.936
Oh, jeez...

15:08.418 --> 15:11.295
This is either a pyramid scheme
or a cult at the very least.

15:11.295 --> 15:12.630
We should get out before it's too late.

15:12.630 --> 15:14.632
Even so, surely Ms. Lee wouldn't...

15:14.632 --> 15:16.542
Aren't you coming up?

15:18.024 --> 15:21.305
Can't you tell me already?

15:21.305 --> 15:24.892
What on earth is this place?

15:24.892 --> 15:27.145
Think of it as a temporary shelter.

15:27.145 --> 15:28.521
A temporary shelter?

15:28.521 --> 15:32.275
Everyone inside is
in the same situation as you, Mr. Bong.

15:32.275 --> 15:34.408
People who had their houses taken
by Heaven Capital

15:34.408 --> 15:36.821
and were thrown onto the streets overnight.

15:36.821 --> 15:38.197
To help these people,

15:38.197 --> 15:41.075
our dance club set this up temporarily.

15:41.075 --> 15:44.078
Did you say this place is

15:44.078 --> 15:46.440
created by a dance club?

15:46.440 --> 15:49.800
Some of our dance club members
went through the same thing.

15:49.800 --> 15:52.327
People who suffered
because of their families!

15:53.379 --> 15:55.122
Please come upstairs.

16:06.856 --> 16:08.552
[Ma Gong Bok]

16:09.228 --> 16:10.929
Make a choice.

16:12.968 --> 16:16.268
You're just taking credit
for what Ma Gong Bok sent.

16:17.403 --> 16:18.504
You know Gong Bok too?

16:18.504 --> 16:21.240
You think I wouldn't notice
a bunch of low-life gangsters like you?

16:21.240 --> 16:22.824
Are you sure he checked the CCTV properly?

16:22.824 --> 16:24.744
We don't have time to doubt this right now.

16:24.744 --> 16:26.820
You said Prosecutor Kang is in danger.

16:30.600 --> 16:34.280
[Hillside Cafe]

16:35.048 --> 16:36.706
[We buy all used phones]

16:56.040 --> 16:57.992
They say they'll cut the eldest grandson
off the family line

16:57.992 --> 16:59.816
for losing the ancestral land.

16:59.816 --> 17:02.760
- What am I supposed to do?
- So why'd you stamp it?

17:02.760 --> 17:04.242
You should try experiencing it yourself.

17:04.242 --> 17:06.494
When they threaten you, who can withstand it?

17:06.494 --> 17:08.246
Hey!

17:08.246 --> 17:11.332
Back in the day, I didn't even flinch
when I got stabbed in the stomach!

17:11.332 --> 17:13.960
How dare you!

17:13.960 --> 17:16.504
- Sir, we're here.
- Okay.

17:16.504 --> 17:19.144
Anyway, you must keep your promise to help me

17:19.144 --> 17:21.416
get that ancestral land back, okay?

17:26.180 --> 17:29.896
Where did everyone else go,
and why do they keep making me do this?

17:29.896 --> 17:32.061
They all said they had appointments.

17:32.061 --> 17:33.729
You know better, so why are you saying that?

17:33.729 --> 17:38.183
They make the mess
and dump all the cleanup on me...

17:39.432 --> 17:40.778
What's this?

17:40.778 --> 17:42.488
Why did you bring these
random stragglers here?

17:42.488 --> 17:45.992
I told you last time.
This is our manager, Mr. Bong.

17:45.992 --> 17:48.953
Say hello. He's the chairman
of the shelter here.

17:48.953 --> 17:51.205
- This is Mr. Park Chun Shik.
- Chairman.

17:51.205 --> 17:54.184
Nice to meet you. I'm Bong Jae Soon.

17:54.184 --> 17:57.378
Oh, you mean that poor guy

17:57.378 --> 18:01.248
who lost his home and job
because of his nephew?

18:02.824 --> 18:06.216
Did you hear about
what kind of place this is?

18:06.216 --> 18:10.224
I only heard it's a temporary shelter.

18:10.224 --> 18:12.685
That's just a fancy way of saying it.

18:12.685 --> 18:14.437
Because of those thugs,

18:14.437 --> 18:17.356
even the displaced people
of Yeongseondo Island are fed and housed.

18:17.356 --> 18:20.985
There's no charity like this anywhere else.

18:20.985 --> 18:23.195
Not a single penny
of government support is coming in.

18:23.195 --> 18:27.176
I'm running this while wearing myself out.

18:27.176 --> 18:29.410
My joints, just really...

18:29.410 --> 18:31.240
You're doing a good deed.

18:31.240 --> 18:33.998
Right, it's a good deed,

18:33.998 --> 18:36.744
but do I have to do all this good deed alone?

18:36.744 --> 18:38.753
You should stay here

18:38.753 --> 18:43.049
and help with cleaning,
maintenance, and cooking.

18:43.049 --> 18:44.967
So, kind of like...

18:44.967 --> 18:47.912
So you're basically
telling us to be servants?

18:47.912 --> 18:49.955
What? Servants?

18:49.955 --> 18:51.499
What do you mean servants?

18:51.499 --> 18:52.708
We'll provide room and board.

18:52.708 --> 18:54.043
And we'll pay you some money too.

18:54.043 --> 18:57.254
We'll also try to find a way to
recover the houses that were illegally taken.

18:57.254 --> 18:59.131
Where else would you find a job like this?

18:59.131 --> 19:01.050
Is there really a way to get our houses back?

19:01.050 --> 19:03.969
The number of victims keeps increasing,

19:03.969 --> 19:06.889
so we're also coming up with our own methods.

19:06.889 --> 19:09.850
Uncle, do you believe that talk?

19:09.850 --> 19:13.479
Aren't they just trying to use us? Huh?

19:13.479 --> 19:15.064
- Wake up!
- No way...

19:15.064 --> 19:17.525
What's with that punk over there?

19:17.525 --> 19:22.655
Sir, my uncle might look a little clueless,

19:22.655 --> 19:25.199
so you think you can just
take advantage of him,

19:25.199 --> 19:28.494
but I'm not someone you can mess with.

19:28.494 --> 19:30.204
Okay?

19:30.204 --> 19:31.624
Uncle, let's go.

19:31.624 --> 19:33.833
Go where?

19:33.833 --> 19:37.002
Then stay in this dump? We have dignity.

19:37.002 --> 19:39.213
What? Yeah!

19:39.213 --> 19:40.381
A dump?

19:40.381 --> 19:42.132
- You little...
- Don't do it, don't do it.

19:42.132 --> 19:44.510
- What are you doing?
- Alright, alright.

19:44.510 --> 19:47.240
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

19:47.240 --> 19:49.223
Just get out of my way, you punk.

19:49.223 --> 19:50.766
Look at you,

19:50.766 --> 19:53.936
with that bad aura,
how can you do anything right?

19:53.936 --> 19:57.992
Pu... Punk?

19:59.650 --> 20:01.902
Sir.

20:01.902 --> 20:03.279
- Do you know who I am?
- Heo Nam Il.

20:03.279 --> 20:05.823
Why are you being so disrespectful?

20:05.823 --> 20:08.659
Uncle, didn't you hear
that old man talking harsh to me?

20:08.659 --> 20:10.411
You're the one being rude.

20:10.411 --> 20:14.081
This little punk... apologize to him now.

20:14.081 --> 20:17.075
Why should I apologize?

20:18.627 --> 20:20.170
Is that right? Huh?

20:20.170 --> 20:22.339
Is that right?

20:22.339 --> 20:26.260
I've got no intention
of being a servant in a dump like this,

20:26.260 --> 20:28.169
so you can do it yourself.

20:30.139 --> 20:31.557
Calm down.

20:31.557 --> 20:33.960
You little punk.

20:33.960 --> 20:37.021
Ugh, I'm sorry.

20:37.021 --> 20:39.565
He's not usually like that.
Why is he behaving this way?

20:39.565 --> 20:41.817
I'll find him soon.

20:41.817 --> 20:43.560
Hey, Heo Nam Il!

20:44.680 --> 20:46.989
Jeez.

20:46.989 --> 20:50.233
Those two don't look alike at all.
Are they really uncle and nephew?

20:52.616 --> 20:54.224
[Ma Gong Bok]

20:56.999 --> 20:58.918
Earlier at the cafe,

20:58.918 --> 21:02.046
the thugs who chased Prosecutor Kang
were Yoo In Goo's men, right?

21:02.046 --> 21:05.841
Why is Yoo In Goo chasing Prosecutor Kang?

21:05.841 --> 21:09.637
- You know, don't you?
- You think I'd tell someone like you?

21:09.637 --> 21:10.696
Someone like me?

21:10.696 --> 21:12.890
The enemy who ruined my plan ten years ago.

21:12.890 --> 21:14.975
The stalker who's been
stalking me for ten years.

21:14.975 --> 21:18.228
A Hwasan faction thug pretending to be
a normal convenience store owner.

21:18.228 --> 21:20.397
So you knew everything, huh?

21:20.397 --> 21:22.191
Don't act like we're close
and keep talking to me.

21:22.191 --> 21:25.235
It'd be nothing for me
to throw you out of this car.

21:25.235 --> 21:26.978
What did you say, you punk?

21:37.581 --> 21:39.041
What happened?

21:39.041 --> 21:41.701
A car fell into the river.

21:44.129 --> 21:45.214
No way...

21:45.214 --> 21:47.707
Was it Prosecutor Kang?

21:49.468 --> 21:50.928
Wait a second.

21:50.928 --> 21:52.513
The car was coming like this, and...

21:52.513 --> 21:54.848
- That punk.
- It's like something bumped it from behind,

21:54.848 --> 21:56.225
and the car was already in the water.

21:56.225 --> 21:59.395
- That guy's one of Yoo In Goo's errand guy.
- It all happened so quickly, so...

21:59.395 --> 22:00.938
I have no idea what was going on.

22:00.938 --> 22:03.348
Why is that punk here at this hour?

22:07.112 --> 22:10.322
Could it be that Prosecutor Kang already
fell victim to Yoo In Goo?

22:10.322 --> 22:13.325
Hey, wait a minute! Where are you going?

22:13.325 --> 22:15.610
Hey, hey, stop! Let's go together!

22:21.458 --> 22:23.159
Nam Il!

22:24.712 --> 22:25.754
Nam Il!

22:25.754 --> 22:27.455
What?

22:28.382 --> 22:30.884
How can you just leave like this?

22:30.884 --> 22:32.386
Let's go back. I will handle it well.

22:32.386 --> 22:34.054
You go yourself.

22:34.054 --> 22:36.306
I'd rather stay at my friend's place.

22:36.306 --> 22:37.808
Don't you know the gangsters are chasing us?

22:37.808 --> 22:41.979
Why would they even chase us now?
They already took our house!

22:41.979 --> 22:45.816
It's because you went
and beat them up for no reason!

22:45.816 --> 22:48.485
Why are you talking like that?

22:48.485 --> 22:50.654
And whose fault do you think
this whole mess is?

22:50.654 --> 22:52.698
- You're saying this is my fault?
- If not yours, then whose?

22:52.698 --> 22:53.907
You are always causing trouble

22:53.907 --> 22:55.701
and have repeated your year for two years.

22:55.701 --> 22:57.494
And now you've even lost the house!

22:57.494 --> 23:00.572
- When are you going to grow up?
- Then just ignore me!

23:01.749 --> 23:04.659
We're not even blood-related anyway.

23:07.379 --> 23:08.589
Nam Il!

23:08.589 --> 23:11.583
Seriously, hey!

23:12.392 --> 23:13.510
Are you really leaving?

23:13.510 --> 23:16.180
You think I call you "Uncle"
because I like it?

23:16.180 --> 23:19.382
I just felt sorry for you, a guy
with no memories and nowhere to go,

23:20.017 --> 23:22.010
so I played along like we were family.

23:23.562 --> 23:25.388
Even Grandpa's house...

23:26.106 --> 23:29.026
It isn't yours, Mr. Bong Jae Soon. It's mine.

23:29.026 --> 23:32.353
So stop saying you'll help me find it
or sticking your nose in.

23:33.072 --> 23:37.317
Let's just go our separate ways, okay?

24:07.231 --> 24:08.315
Hey, did you find her?

24:08.315 --> 24:09.608
We're one step too late.

24:09.608 --> 24:12.444
Prosecutor Kang's car
fell into Yeongseon River.

24:12.444 --> 24:14.947
It seems she was being chased by Yoo In Goo.

24:14.947 --> 24:15.948
Are you saying she's dead?

24:15.948 --> 24:18.158
I don't know. They're still
recovering the vehicle.

24:18.158 --> 24:19.451
Where are you? Let's meet and talk.

24:19.451 --> 24:21.370
No, no.

24:21.370 --> 24:25.582
No, Ho Myung, if that's the case,
just go back.

24:25.582 --> 24:27.492
What are you talking about?

24:29.128 --> 24:32.089
You said you came out
to see a show with your family.

24:32.089 --> 24:33.424
Go back before it's too late.

24:33.424 --> 24:36.635
Go back? I need to confirm
whether Prosecutor Kang is alive.

24:36.635 --> 24:38.053
If they're pulling the car out,

24:38.053 --> 24:41.181
it'll take half a day
to confirm her condition.

24:41.181 --> 24:43.559
I'll monitor the police radio.

24:43.559 --> 24:44.685
You should go back now.

24:44.685 --> 24:47.646
The show is over anyway.
It's already too late.

24:47.646 --> 24:51.859
The longer you drag it out,
the worse it gets in a marriage fight, man.

24:51.859 --> 24:54.027
You didn't even secure Prosecutor Kang,

24:54.027 --> 24:56.145
now you want to lose your wife too?

24:59.366 --> 25:02.077
Alright. Call me if anything happens.

25:02.077 --> 25:03.778
Got it.

25:44.995 --> 25:46.163
There...

25:46.163 --> 25:48.290
- There's someone over there.
- What? Where?

25:48.290 --> 25:49.416
There!

25:49.416 --> 25:51.993
- Where?
- There, there!

25:53.003 --> 25:54.787
What's going on over there?

25:58.842 --> 26:00.510
Miss, wake up.

26:00.510 --> 26:03.430
Miss, please wake up, okay?

26:03.430 --> 26:05.933
Grandpa, this person isn't a young lady.

26:05.933 --> 26:08.968
He's a man, look!

26:43.336 --> 26:45.722
Bong...

26:45.722 --> 26:47.632
[Resident Registration Card, Bong Jae Soon]
Jae Soon?

27:04.366 --> 27:09.454
I can't remember... anything.

27:09.454 --> 27:12.073
Really, you can't remember anything?

27:12.833 --> 27:19.214
Age, name, parents... nothing?

27:19.214 --> 27:22.834
No, I don't know.

27:30.309 --> 27:33.520
You don't have a mom and dad either, sir?

27:33.520 --> 27:37.482
I don't know whether I have them or not.

27:37.482 --> 27:39.860
If you really don't have one,

27:39.860 --> 27:41.987
want to join our family?

27:41.987 --> 27:44.906
- Family?
- I don't just make anyone family,

27:44.906 --> 27:47.117
but I'll make an exception for you.

27:47.117 --> 27:49.578
Not Grandpa and Dad though.

27:49.578 --> 27:51.204
How about Uncle?

27:51.204 --> 27:53.457
Uncle?

27:53.457 --> 27:57.627
What does Uncle have to do?

27:57.627 --> 28:00.255
What else? You just play with me.

28:00.255 --> 28:02.165
Always.

28:03.800 --> 28:07.054
So from now on, you're my uncle?

28:07.054 --> 28:09.630
Uncle, play with me.

28:10.888 --> 28:12.591
[Resident Registration Card, Bong Jae Soon]

28:18.337 --> 28:20.100
Come on.

28:24.446 --> 28:27.240
Are you bored, Uncle?

28:27.240 --> 28:30.443
If you're bored, help me with this.

28:31.816 --> 28:33.864
Okay.

28:39.294 --> 28:41.004
You must never let go.

28:41.004 --> 28:42.672
Is this your first time
riding a two-wheeled bike?

28:42.672 --> 28:44.374
Yeah.

28:46.176 --> 28:48.461
I'll never let go.

28:52.137 --> 28:54.008
Alright.

29:02.943 --> 29:05.144
Where are you now?

29:09.199 --> 29:10.900
Huh?

29:14.621 --> 29:16.322
What?

29:20.836 --> 29:22.337
Oh? Hey, hey!

29:22.337 --> 29:23.463
Hey!

29:23.463 --> 29:24.631
Hey!

29:24.631 --> 29:25.715
Hey!

29:25.715 --> 29:26.842
Are you alright?

29:26.842 --> 29:28.260
Hey!

29:28.260 --> 29:29.970
Oh, no.

29:29.970 --> 29:31.596
Are you okay? Hey!

29:31.596 --> 29:34.132
What should I do... hey!

29:47.028 --> 29:49.156
Are you coming to? It's okay.

29:49.156 --> 29:51.825
You're alive, you're alive. I'll call 911.

29:51.825 --> 29:53.702
I'll report it to 911.

29:53.702 --> 29:55.078
Don't report it.

29:55.078 --> 29:57.071
Don't call it in.

29:58.957 --> 30:01.334
Hey, hey!

30:01.334 --> 30:04.370
Oh no, this is driving me crazy, wait...

30:12.904 --> 30:14.632
Darn it.

30:14.632 --> 30:17.809
Don't bother helping
and get blamed for it. Just give up.

30:17.809 --> 30:20.395
If the nephew is like that,
the uncle can't be any different.

30:20.395 --> 30:22.689
No, I'm telling you he's not like that.

30:22.689 --> 30:24.891
Why isn't he picking up?

30:29.905 --> 30:33.158
Didn't you say you had a date today?

30:33.158 --> 30:36.077
I don't know. Don't ask me anything.

30:36.077 --> 30:38.455
Looks like you got dumped.

30:38.455 --> 30:41.666
What? Didn't you say
he had a thing for you, Officer Park?

30:41.666 --> 30:43.126
It's still unclear.

30:43.126 --> 30:45.504
I've been dumped after meeting someone,

30:45.504 --> 30:47.130
but not before even meeting them.

30:47.130 --> 30:49.081
Doesn't seem like it.

30:52.010 --> 30:53.386
Darn it.

30:53.386 --> 30:56.890
O Ran, didn't you say you were
watching a show with your family today?

30:56.890 --> 31:01.520
We watched the show, and I'm on my way back
after dropping Ji Woo off.

31:01.520 --> 31:02.521
Already?

31:02.521 --> 31:04.147
Didn't you say you're going
somewhere nice afterward?

31:04.147 --> 31:06.057
Don't ask me anything.

31:07.275 --> 31:10.320
Oh dear, things are bad here too.

31:10.320 --> 31:11.446
Oh, right, Ye Ji.

31:11.446 --> 31:13.782
Did the person you said
you'd bring leave already?

31:13.782 --> 31:15.951
Isn't he supposed to be working here?

31:15.951 --> 31:19.987
Well, he's not answering right now.

31:32.717 --> 31:35.387
Seems she's hurt all over.

31:35.387 --> 31:37.055
Shouldn't we take her to a hospital?

31:37.055 --> 31:41.184
No, no, she said,
"No hospital, no police, no 911."

31:41.184 --> 31:44.762
She kept mumbling the entire way here.

31:46.106 --> 31:48.149
Something feels off.

31:48.149 --> 31:50.902
Only people trying to avoid the law

31:50.902 --> 31:54.114
- say things like that.
- Oh, my!

31:54.114 --> 31:56.825
Then is this woman a criminal?

31:56.825 --> 31:58.326
No, she isn't.

31:58.326 --> 32:00.278
She seems like a prosecutor.

32:02.789 --> 32:05.041
- She's a prosecutor.
- Oh, my.

32:05.041 --> 32:07.252
Given how she insisted
on avoiding everything,

32:07.252 --> 32:10.472
this doesn't look like a simple injury.

32:10.472 --> 32:15.385
- Well...
- Then let's just wait until she wakes up.

32:15.385 --> 32:16.886
If something seems off when she wakes up,

32:16.886 --> 32:18.513
we can report it through Mi Kyeong.

32:18.513 --> 32:21.424
Oh, okay, let's do that.

32:22.601 --> 32:26.088
Oh, right. You said your name
is Bong Jae Soon, right?

32:26.088 --> 32:27.144
Yes.

32:27.144 --> 32:28.732
Since you've left even your nephew behind,

32:28.732 --> 32:31.176
looks like you've decided to work here
despite how unappealing it is?

32:31.176 --> 32:33.778
I didn't leave him behind, but yes,

32:33.778 --> 32:36.281
I'll give the job a try.

32:36.281 --> 32:39.242
Then let's start right away.

32:39.242 --> 32:41.244
Don't even think about sleeping from today.

32:41.244 --> 32:44.331
Stay here and watch her.

32:44.331 --> 32:49.169
And when she wakes up,
notify all of us. Got it?

32:49.169 --> 32:50.670
Me, alone?

32:50.670 --> 32:53.465
Of course, the person
who brought her is responsible.

32:53.465 --> 32:56.051
Just don't end up holding a corpse
in my building.

32:56.051 --> 32:58.127
You know what I mean, right?

33:02.182 --> 33:06.376
I surrender! Please save me! Oh, my gosh!

33:07.020 --> 33:10.065
Huh? It's Dad. Dad!

33:10.065 --> 33:11.149
Ji Woo!

33:11.149 --> 33:12.233
I'm late, right?

33:12.233 --> 33:14.402
- I'm sorry, sorry, sorry.
- It's okay.

33:14.402 --> 33:15.528
- Did you enjoy the show?
- Yeah.

33:15.528 --> 33:18.990
- You're back.
- Yes.

33:18.990 --> 33:22.056
Dad, isn't the new mask cool?

33:22.056 --> 33:25.704
Yeah, it's cool, it's cool.

33:26.915 --> 33:28.083
- Dad.
- Huh?

33:28.083 --> 33:31.544
Did you beat the villains well?

33:31.544 --> 33:33.245
Yeah.

33:34.047 --> 33:35.632
But where's Mom?

33:35.632 --> 33:38.385
She dropped Ji Woo off and went back out.

33:38.385 --> 33:41.554
- Where?
- I don't know, but she got really worked up

33:41.554 --> 33:45.466
and said she needed to blow off
some steam or something.

33:47.310 --> 33:51.097
It's okay. Mom will understand too.

34:09.352 --> 34:11.752
[Dumplings available for takeout]

34:25.557 --> 34:29.510
I'm sorry. I really have nothing to say.

34:30.353 --> 34:32.230
Why don't you have anything to say?

34:32.230 --> 34:33.857
Say it.

34:33.857 --> 34:36.392
Let me decide whether to forgive you or not.

34:46.578 --> 34:50.832
Among my army buddies,
there's one named Tae Sik.

34:50.832 --> 34:54.502
He came to Yeongseondo Island
for a visit and got into a car accident.

34:54.502 --> 34:57.255
He panicked,
wondering if there's anyone he knows

34:57.255 --> 34:58.298
on Yeongseondo Island,

34:58.298 --> 35:00.550
and I was the first person he thought of.

35:00.550 --> 35:02.260
So what could I do?

35:02.260 --> 35:04.012
I couldn't just pretend
not to know, you know?

35:04.012 --> 35:08.183
I helped him handle the accident
and calm him down,

35:08.183 --> 35:12.437
and before I knew it,
it's already gotten this late.

35:12.437 --> 35:14.439
I see.

35:14.439 --> 35:19.527
Your friend just happened to
get into an accident here.

35:19.527 --> 35:20.612
Yeah, yeah.

35:20.612 --> 35:23.080
Well, then I guess it couldn't be helped.

35:23.080 --> 35:24.115
- Right?
- Yeah.

35:24.115 --> 35:27.076
- You understand, right?
- I understand.

35:27.076 --> 35:30.830
But you actually have a military buddy?

35:30.830 --> 35:34.793
I didn't see any friends at the wedding,

35:34.793 --> 35:36.294
so I thought you didn't keep any.

35:36.294 --> 35:39.172
I do have friends. I have friends.

35:39.172 --> 35:41.049
He couldn't come
because he was busy at the time.

35:41.049 --> 35:42.926
He called to say he was sorry
for missing the wedding.

35:44.928 --> 35:48.473
But you know, when I asked you before,

35:48.473 --> 35:51.675
you said you were exempt
from military service.

35:55.063 --> 35:56.931
- Did I?
- Yeah.

36:05.073 --> 36:06.857
What's wrong with you these days?

36:07.700 --> 36:09.410
You keep ditching the restaurant
whenever you can

36:09.410 --> 36:11.871
and you even forgot to pick up Ji Woo.

36:11.871 --> 36:14.290
It feels like your mind is somewhere else.

36:14.290 --> 36:15.500
And today too.

36:15.500 --> 36:17.794
You even lied about where you were.

36:17.794 --> 36:20.162
What are you hiding from me?

36:27.011 --> 36:28.054
Do you have another woman?

36:28.054 --> 36:29.806
- No, what are you...
- Then what is it?

36:29.806 --> 36:32.600
Speak up. Stop lying and tell me the truth.

36:32.600 --> 36:35.311
No, I'm not doing anything weird.

36:35.311 --> 36:37.846
Yeah, you're always like this.

36:39.774 --> 36:41.901
If you want to do as you please,
go live outside.

36:41.901 --> 36:44.487
Yeah, just leave, okay?

36:44.487 --> 36:47.773
Let's take some time apart.

36:49.367 --> 36:51.244
What?

36:51.244 --> 36:54.831
Then... are you suggesting a separation?

36:54.831 --> 36:56.916
Then what about the restaurant?
What about Ji Woo?

36:56.916 --> 36:58.793
The restaurant runs fine without you.

36:58.793 --> 37:01.453
I can take care of Ji Woo by myself too.

37:04.132 --> 37:08.136
You decide. Either tell me the truth,

37:08.136 --> 37:10.588
or just get kicked out.

37:23.234 --> 37:25.153
It's not your shift yet.
What brings you here?

37:25.153 --> 37:27.697
- Gong Bok.
- Why did you ask about the CCTV earlier?

37:27.697 --> 37:29.157
Is something wrong?

37:29.157 --> 37:34.069
Have you been spying
on Jeong Ho Myung lately?

37:35.038 --> 37:37.957
Jeong... Oh! That guy, Jeong Ho Myung?

37:37.957 --> 37:39.959
Did you notice anything strange?

37:39.959 --> 37:43.996
Like he seemed to recognize us?

37:48.384 --> 37:50.428
Not at all.

37:50.428 --> 37:52.680
I've never even seen his shadow.

37:52.680 --> 37:56.142
I told you. I'd forget everything.

37:56.142 --> 37:58.436
I had completely forgotten.

37:58.436 --> 38:00.855
- Right?
- Yes.

38:00.855 --> 38:02.315
Then, that's good.

38:02.315 --> 38:03.524
Yeah.

38:03.524 --> 38:08.937
Well, just a while ago, I thought I saw him.

38:10.531 --> 38:13.284
Oh! I see.

38:13.284 --> 38:17.455
Well, it's the next neighborhood.
Maybe you just passed by each other.

38:17.455 --> 38:19.948
Anything happened?

38:20.667 --> 38:23.336
I'll head inside first.

38:23.336 --> 38:25.037
Yeah.

38:34.472 --> 38:36.298
What's going on?

38:37.141 --> 38:39.343
Why has he gotten so sharp?

38:44.712 --> 38:46.536
[Restricted number]

38:51.848 --> 38:52.907
Yes, boss.

38:52.907 --> 38:55.910
So, how is the job going?

38:55.910 --> 38:57.704
What about Prosecutor Kang?

38:57.704 --> 38:58.830
I met her.

38:58.830 --> 39:00.906
What did you talk about?

39:03.543 --> 39:06.421
She said she'll
look into your case properly, boss.

39:06.421 --> 39:09.382
Is that all? Was there
nothing else discussed?

39:09.382 --> 39:11.009
Is she completely useless?

39:11.009 --> 39:12.793
I'm sorry.

39:13.720 --> 39:15.930
No, never mind.

39:15.930 --> 39:18.725
You can't expect to be full
on the first bite.

39:18.725 --> 39:21.552
What happens next is more important.

39:23.312 --> 39:26.024
I only trust you.

39:26.024 --> 39:29.485
You know what I mean, right?

39:29.485 --> 39:33.731
Yes, I'll do my best no matter what.

40:02.185 --> 40:04.228
Is something wrong?

40:04.228 --> 40:08.057
If you can't come,
you should at least tell me.

40:09.192 --> 40:13.029
Sir, nothing serious is going on, right?

40:13.029 --> 40:17.075
I'm still at the cafe in front of the cinema.

40:17.075 --> 40:19.744
Please contact me when you see the message.

40:19.744 --> 40:21.487
I'll be waiting.

40:27.368 --> 40:30.984
[Officer Park Mi Kyeong]

40:50.149 --> 40:55.404
Fate always arrives without warning.

40:55.404 --> 40:57.907
On a day you least expect it,

40:57.907 --> 41:00.535
it quietly sits down next to you

41:00.535 --> 41:03.529
in an ordinary moment.

41:04.705 --> 41:07.208
And because of that connection,

41:07.208 --> 41:11.119
you sometimes discover a side of yourself
you never knew.

41:12.200 --> 41:13.832
Here's the first song.

41:13.832 --> 41:16.667
It's 'Rebirth' by Yoon Jong Shin.

41:30.344 --> 41:31.440
Thanks for your hard work.

41:31.440 --> 41:34.142
- Yeah, good work.
- I'll head out first.

41:36.445 --> 41:39.115
This is no time for jokes. Wait.

41:39.115 --> 41:41.117
- Boss, did you know?
- What?

41:41.117 --> 41:43.327
A local police station just moved nearby.

41:43.327 --> 41:47.123
Lately, the police on night shifts
keep coming to our convenience store.

41:47.123 --> 41:48.791
Why did those guys

41:48.791 --> 41:51.377
- have to move here of all places?
- What do we do now?

41:51.377 --> 41:54.130
We might not even be able
to find the item like this.

41:54.130 --> 41:56.924
We can't exactly put up
a 'No police allowed' sign.

41:56.924 --> 42:01.053
Just wait and see.
If I were dealing with police, I'd just...

42:01.053 --> 42:02.754
You'd just hit them?

42:03.848 --> 42:05.808
I'll act up all I want

42:05.808 --> 42:08.844
and make sure they can't even
come near our convenience store.

42:27.705 --> 42:29.781
Aren't you going to ring me up?

42:38.090 --> 42:40.167
Darn it.

42:41.010 --> 42:43.337
Darn it, jeez...

43:02.907 --> 43:06.276
Ring me up, please.

43:18.839 --> 43:21.133
Where's the microwave?

43:21.133 --> 43:22.834
There...

43:24.845 --> 43:26.546
Thank you.

45:18.542 --> 45:20.660
It's 1,600 won.

45:36.102 --> 45:38.428
One is for you, sir.

45:39.939 --> 45:43.651
It's nothing big, just a thank-you.

45:43.651 --> 45:45.811
I'll come often from now on.

46:03.337 --> 46:05.372
How am I supposed to drink this?

46:44.837 --> 46:46.881
I got kicked out.

46:46.881 --> 46:48.582
Why?

46:52.845 --> 46:55.931
I was observing the accident site
of Prosecutor Kang,

46:55.931 --> 46:58.434
but the Yeongseon River's
current is too strong.

46:58.434 --> 47:00.728
So I think it'll take
some time to pull the car up.

47:00.728 --> 47:02.480
Same for recovering the body.

47:02.480 --> 47:04.690
- Is she dead?
- I don't know.

47:04.690 --> 47:08.018
We just have to keep hoping
until a body appears.

47:12.990 --> 47:15.242
Are you okay?

47:15.242 --> 47:16.827
I'm fine, man.

47:16.827 --> 47:18.954
This is nothing.

47:18.954 --> 47:21.373
Take care of yourself.
You're not getting any younger.

47:21.373 --> 47:24.084
And tone down that street vendor disguise.

47:24.084 --> 47:26.003
Come on!

47:26.003 --> 47:28.616
No one's going to hand you information
just because you sit in an office

47:28.616 --> 47:30.049
wearing a suit like before.

47:30.049 --> 47:31.258
And what's wrong with being a street vendor?

47:31.258 --> 47:33.385
I get information, I make a living.

47:33.385 --> 47:35.054
It's perfect.

47:35.054 --> 47:37.556
There's nothing like it.

47:37.556 --> 47:39.683
You really never change.

47:39.683 --> 47:41.685
Don't you ever get tired?

47:41.685 --> 47:43.470
Are you tired?

47:49.235 --> 47:51.612
It's already been ten years

47:51.612 --> 47:54.022
since we came to Yeongseondo Island.

47:55.324 --> 47:57.400
Time really flies, right?

48:00.955 --> 48:02.540
Ten years ago,

48:02.540 --> 48:05.292
when we first came to Yeongseondo Island

48:05.292 --> 48:09.829
I thought this operation
would be over quickly.

48:12.132 --> 48:14.134
But that darn Bulgae

48:14.134 --> 48:17.555
is nowhere to be found,
no matter how hard we search.

48:17.555 --> 48:20.590
And the tracker's gone completely silent.

48:21.976 --> 48:23.656
[Inn]
His tone is a bit strange,

48:23.656 --> 48:25.864
and he's shorter than me.

48:25.864 --> 48:28.104
- About the face...
- Do you think there's only one outsider

48:28.104 --> 48:29.650
in a tourist town?

48:29.650 --> 48:31.351
Jeez.

48:33.000 --> 48:34.321
Can I take a look inside there?

48:34.321 --> 48:37.899
Stop bothering me and get out of here
before I call the police.

48:52.104 --> 48:53.192
[O Ran Chinese Restaurant]

48:54.888 --> 48:55.912
[Delivery Driver Wanted]

48:55.912 --> 48:57.052
Delivery's here.

48:57.052 --> 48:58.053
- Oh.
- Hello.

48:58.053 --> 49:00.171
- The room at the end.
- Okay.

49:06.353 --> 49:08.388
Delivery's here!

49:10.504 --> 49:12.520
[O Ran Chinese Restaurant]

49:13.777 --> 49:20.650
The idea of becoming a delivery guy
was just a way to investigate freely.

49:25.372 --> 49:31.086
You're not exactly what we're looking for
in an employee.

49:31.086 --> 49:33.455
Hiring you will be difficult.

49:47.519 --> 49:48.854
- Who is he?
- Huh?

49:48.854 --> 49:52.107
He came for an interview,
but he's a bit older than expected.

49:52.107 --> 49:53.808
You're hired!

49:54.610 --> 49:57.404
- Wait...
- I said he's hired.

49:57.404 --> 49:59.439
You're hired!

50:02.076 --> 50:03.494
I'm back!

50:03.494 --> 50:05.204
- Welcome back.
- Cold, isn't it?

50:05.204 --> 50:06.955
Well...

50:06.955 --> 50:08.791
Enjoy your meal.

50:08.791 --> 50:10.918
Oh, were you cold?

50:10.918 --> 50:13.796
No, just a little bit.

50:13.796 --> 50:16.757
Sir, stop eating and go deliver.

50:16.757 --> 50:18.258
I decided not to make deliveries.

50:18.258 --> 50:21.720
Start from today,
and Ho Myung will do hall serving there.

50:21.720 --> 50:22.721
I'm fine though.

50:22.721 --> 50:24.598
You mustn't catch a cold.

50:24.598 --> 50:26.674
I already caught a cold.

50:30.521 --> 50:32.764
Be careful, okay?

50:34.358 --> 50:38.445
But the plan kept going differently

50:38.445 --> 50:40.730
- from what I had in mind.
- Get back to work.

51:03.053 --> 51:05.597
It's tough, isn't it? I'll help you.

51:05.597 --> 51:08.475
I was hired as a delivery guy, right?

51:08.475 --> 51:09.893
Why do you keep making me do restaurant work?

51:09.893 --> 51:12.637
Well, that's...

51:15.524 --> 51:18.902
Ho Myung, you're just so good at work.

51:18.902 --> 51:22.072
It's basically a promotion.

51:22.072 --> 51:23.073
A promotion?

51:23.073 --> 51:26.943
Yes. A promotion.

51:31.331 --> 51:33.208
- Are you crying?
- No, it's just...

51:33.208 --> 51:34.626
It's because of the onions.

51:34.626 --> 51:36.003
Ah! My eyes are burning.

51:36.003 --> 51:38.380
Wait, you shouldn't touch it with your hands.

51:38.380 --> 51:41.512
Hold still, let me... What now?

51:41.512 --> 51:43.251
What should I do?

51:52.296 --> 51:57.557
Ho Myung, your eyes are really pretty.

52:01.111 --> 52:03.197
I guess I should peel more onions.

52:03.197 --> 52:05.106
The onions... huh?

52:07.576 --> 52:08.648
Wait a minute.

52:08.648 --> 52:11.413
No, this isn't right, wait...

52:11.413 --> 52:14.833
No, this isn't right...

52:14.833 --> 52:17.869
At this point, both life and the operation

52:19.087 --> 52:21.789
have become completely unpredictable.

52:24.468 --> 52:27.012
Who would've thought
ten years would fly by like this?

52:27.012 --> 52:30.682
That's why I told you
not to get married, but you did anyway.

52:30.682 --> 52:31.892
You're regretting it now, aren't you?

52:31.892 --> 52:34.102
Who says I regret it?

52:34.102 --> 52:37.773
I've never regretted marrying O Ran,
not even once.

52:37.773 --> 52:39.724
Then what's the problem?

52:41.235 --> 52:42.936
It's just...

52:46.824 --> 52:51.277
I've been feeling uneasy lately.

52:54.915 --> 52:56.699
About what?

52:59.127 --> 53:04.883
I'm worried the next ten years
will fly by just like this.

53:04.883 --> 53:06.635
With menopause and all,

53:06.635 --> 53:09.847
my health is getting worse every day,

53:09.847 --> 53:12.266
but Ji Woo is just a kindergartener.

53:12.266 --> 53:14.601
Our livelihood isn't exactly stable.

53:14.601 --> 53:17.062
When I first had a family, I was just happy.

53:17.062 --> 53:18.939
It felt like I could do anything.

53:18.939 --> 53:22.767
But these days, seeing how fast time passes

53:24.069 --> 53:25.937
really scares me.

53:27.656 --> 53:30.367
I'm losing confidence

53:30.367 --> 53:34.070
that I can take care of my family

53:35.956 --> 53:37.991
without anything going wrong.

53:41.128 --> 53:44.622
Seeing you mope around, I know exactly why.

53:48.135 --> 53:51.013
It's because you're getting old.
That's all it is.

53:51.013 --> 53:54.057
At our age, is there anyone
who isn't worried about the future?

53:54.057 --> 53:56.768
- Are you the same way?
- Of course.

53:56.768 --> 53:58.562
You think I'm any different?

53:58.562 --> 54:01.306
I just go with it and live on.

54:02.858 --> 54:06.904
Thinking I've only lived half my life so far.

54:06.904 --> 54:10.273
We just keep dealing
with whatever's in front of us,

54:10.991 --> 54:12.775
and somehow life goes on.

54:13.577 --> 54:15.621
And you...

54:15.621 --> 54:19.458
It's because you keep trying to
handle everything by yourself.

54:19.458 --> 54:21.209
This operation isn't going well either.

54:21.209 --> 54:24.421
Things with O Ran lately
are affecting you psychologically too.

54:24.421 --> 54:28.592
That's why, the older we get,
the more we need

54:28.592 --> 54:31.637
to depend on each other.

54:31.637 --> 54:33.838
You haven't learned a thing with age.

54:41.647 --> 54:43.556
Anyway, what I'm saying is

54:44.232 --> 54:47.268
instead of the two of us doing this alone,

54:48.195 --> 54:52.324
how about recruiting a new member?

54:52.324 --> 54:53.742
Who?

54:53.742 --> 54:55.661
Is there still someone connected to the NIS?

54:55.661 --> 54:59.781
No need to look far. There's someone nearby.

55:03.251 --> 55:07.089
Someone who's just as desperate as we are

55:07.089 --> 55:09.716
to take down Han Kyung Wook and Yoo In Goo.

55:09.716 --> 55:12.168
Someone who could go toe-to-toe
with you ten years ago

55:12.168 --> 55:15.588
and can easily take a beating
so tough to handle now.

55:17.224 --> 55:20.510
How about Kang Beom Ryong? Kang Beom Ryong.

55:21.895 --> 55:23.814
Stop talking nonsense.

55:23.814 --> 55:26.274
- Are you drunk?
- I'm not drunk, man.

55:26.274 --> 55:29.194
There you go again,
not listening to a word I said.

55:29.194 --> 55:33.198
Even so, we're NIS agents,
for crying out loud.

55:33.198 --> 55:35.942
How can we team up with thugs?

55:37.661 --> 55:42.499
Ho Myung, let's be realistic.

55:42.499 --> 55:45.293
You're almost fifty.

55:45.293 --> 55:46.920
You're getting old.

55:46.920 --> 55:48.380
Just like the other day, man,

55:48.380 --> 55:50.590
when you went to meet Yoo In Goo alone.

55:50.590 --> 55:54.419
Would you have failed no matter
how many men they had back in the day?

55:55.637 --> 55:58.223
If you keep acting
like your NIS days and going solo,

55:58.223 --> 56:00.183
you'll end up with nothing.

56:00.183 --> 56:05.346
Back then, it was... Well...

56:10.402 --> 56:12.821
I'm already feeling down enough.

56:12.821 --> 56:15.356
Why do you keep bringing up my age?

56:56.907 --> 56:58.200
- You're here, boss!
- Boss!

56:58.200 --> 57:00.035
Yeah.

57:00.035 --> 57:01.244
Any word from Sergeant Kim?

57:01.244 --> 57:03.080
They're still pulling up the vehicle.

57:03.080 --> 57:05.999
As soon as a body is found,
it'll be ruled an accidental death.

57:05.999 --> 57:09.795
Sergeant Kim is such a slowpoke
with his work.

57:09.795 --> 57:11.338
- Kang Sik.
- Yes.

57:11.338 --> 57:15.342
You need to see that bloated corpse
with your own eyes.

57:15.342 --> 57:16.676
Understood.

57:16.676 --> 57:18.845
Kang Sik, we're almost there.

57:18.845 --> 57:20.263
Once we handle that martial arts master,

57:20.263 --> 57:23.225
- it'll be smooth sailing until the deal day.
- But, boss.

57:23.225 --> 57:27.104
About that martial arts master...
We can't find him anywhere.

57:27.104 --> 57:29.773
Phone tracking only works
at the cell-tower level, so it's limited.

57:29.773 --> 57:33.568
- So you're saying we should give up?
- No, we have to keep looking.

57:33.568 --> 57:36.780
But I'm just saying
we should consider the possibility

57:36.780 --> 57:38.606
we won't find him in time.

57:41.201 --> 57:43.495
Good, now you're finally using your head.

57:43.495 --> 57:44.579
Pardon?

57:44.579 --> 57:47.165
There you go. Now you're using your head.

57:47.165 --> 57:49.918
Double our manpower on the day of the deal.

57:49.918 --> 57:51.253
Numbers win fights.

57:51.253 --> 57:52.796
What's he going to do if we overwhelm him?

57:52.796 --> 57:54.548
You said we should keep it small

57:54.548 --> 57:57.259
because Mr. Han might notice
if we move too many people.

57:57.259 --> 57:59.469
Then we'll use fresh faces.

57:59.469 --> 58:02.639
- Fresh faces?
- You know some young up-and-comers

58:02.639 --> 58:04.015
around here, right?

58:04.015 --> 58:05.736
Round them all up.

58:05.736 --> 58:08.687
Our guys already got beaten up.

58:08.687 --> 58:10.888
Will those kids really help?

58:11.523 --> 58:13.275
At least they'll be firewood

58:13.275 --> 58:15.935
to keep the In Goo faction's flames burning.

58:26.119 --> 58:27.956
Oh, man.

58:27.956 --> 58:29.958
It's cold out.

58:29.958 --> 58:31.993
Thanks for your hard work.

58:33.003 --> 58:34.745
Thank you.

58:35.589 --> 58:39.336
Looks like there hasn't been
much progress. Right?

58:40.010 --> 58:41.636
What progress?

58:41.636 --> 58:43.138
We're just wasting our time.

58:43.138 --> 58:44.181
Wasting your time?

58:44.181 --> 58:46.016
Why do you say it's a waste of time?

58:46.016 --> 58:49.060
The current in the Yeongseon River is strong.

58:49.060 --> 58:51.563
So if someone falls in, they don't stay put.

58:51.563 --> 58:54.399
They just get swept away.

58:54.399 --> 58:56.193
If there wasn't a body in the car,

58:56.193 --> 59:01.865
I think she definitely
got carried toward Nakwon Beach.

59:01.865 --> 59:02.866
Nakwon Beach?

59:02.866 --> 59:04.242
I'm telling you.

59:04.242 --> 59:06.119
If she drifted that way,

59:06.119 --> 59:08.038
she might've survived if she got lucky.

59:08.038 --> 59:09.331
I've seen plenty of people

59:09.331 --> 59:12.626
walk away fine after falling in here.

59:12.626 --> 59:15.578
No matter how much I say it,
they won't listen.

59:17.255 --> 59:21.000
That's how government workers are.
So frustrating.

59:24.846 --> 59:27.256
Keep pulling it up, pulling it up!

59:29.976 --> 59:31.886
Nakwon Beach?

01:00:07.389 --> 01:00:08.848
Oh, you startled me!

01:00:08.848 --> 01:00:10.016
- Are you awake?
- Who are you?

01:00:10.016 --> 01:00:11.184
- Who are you?
- Prosecutor.

01:00:11.184 --> 01:00:12.686
- Who are you?
- Prosecutor... wait.

01:00:12.686 --> 01:00:14.771
Wait, wait, Prosecutor, it's me!

01:00:14.771 --> 01:00:16.856
- Prosecutor.
- But how do you know I'm a prosecutor?

01:00:16.856 --> 01:00:18.641
Don't you remember?

01:00:19.359 --> 01:00:20.902
It's me.

01:00:20.902 --> 01:00:25.115
- Who are you?
- Yesterday, I saved you at the beach.

01:00:25.115 --> 01:00:26.783
I carried you here yesterday.

01:00:26.783 --> 01:00:28.535
Yesterday?

01:00:28.535 --> 01:00:31.121
Are you alright? Are you coming to?

01:00:31.121 --> 01:00:32.822
Hey!

01:00:33.704 --> 01:00:35.560
Yes.

01:00:36.167 --> 01:00:37.502
Wait, you shouldn't get up yet.

01:00:37.502 --> 01:00:41.000
You shouldn't get up yet, just a moment.

01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:42.415
Just a moment.

01:00:45.427 --> 01:00:47.345
Wait a moment.

01:00:47.345 --> 01:00:50.265
Let me check your temperature. Just a moment.

01:00:50.265 --> 01:00:53.393
37.8 degrees. It's come down a bit.
Just a moment.

01:00:53.393 --> 01:00:56.146
You fell into the sea yesterday,

01:00:56.146 --> 01:00:59.176
so you need to stay warm.

01:00:59.176 --> 01:01:01.352
Hold on a moment.

01:01:01.352 --> 01:01:04.603
There you go.

01:01:05.488 --> 01:01:06.865
Even if you seem fine,

01:01:06.865 --> 01:01:08.908
your temperature could suddenly go up.

01:01:08.908 --> 01:01:10.869
Well, the thing is...

01:01:10.869 --> 01:01:12.203
Let me get you some water.

01:01:12.203 --> 01:01:13.580
- Just a moment.
- No, wait.

01:01:13.580 --> 01:01:17.751
- Pardon?
- I remember you rescuing me yesterday.

01:01:17.751 --> 01:01:19.502
But where am I?

01:01:19.502 --> 01:01:20.670
This doesn't seem like a hospital.

01:01:20.670 --> 01:01:22.496
Here?

01:01:23.757 --> 01:01:27.719
A temporary... shelter.

01:01:27.719 --> 01:01:29.064
Shelter?

01:01:29.064 --> 01:01:32.182
Wow, that martial arts master
or whatever must be really scary.

01:01:32.182 --> 01:01:35.259
Still, isn't Mr. Yoo pushing things too hard?

01:01:36.686 --> 01:01:40.431
The look in his eyes says
he's about to stir up trouble again.

01:01:41.691 --> 01:01:45.111
That prosecutor situation
was handled cleanly, right?

01:01:45.111 --> 01:01:47.364
Yes, once they recover the body,

01:01:47.364 --> 01:01:49.565
it'll be ruled an accident.

01:01:57.957 --> 01:02:00.168
As long as this doesn't surface.

01:02:00.168 --> 01:02:02.796
It even has Boss In Goo's voice on it.

01:02:02.796 --> 01:02:05.122
He won't be able to escape if this gets out.

01:02:06.424 --> 01:02:08.426
Okay, good job!

01:02:08.426 --> 01:02:10.169
You've worked hard.

01:02:11.179 --> 01:02:13.473
But sir,

01:02:13.473 --> 01:02:15.308
if this gets to the police,

01:02:15.308 --> 01:02:17.644
I'll get arrested too.

01:02:17.644 --> 01:02:19.145
- Mr. Gold.
- Yeah.

01:02:19.145 --> 01:02:22.184
I'm the one who most wants
Mr. Yoo to finish his drug deal safely.

01:02:22.184 --> 01:02:23.608
Don't worry, man.

01:02:23.608 --> 01:02:27.570
I have absolutely no intention
of giving this to the police.

01:02:27.570 --> 01:02:29.271
Wait.

01:02:30.115 --> 01:02:32.992
Then what are you planning to use it for?

01:02:32.992 --> 01:02:35.720
We'll think about that in due time.

01:02:35.720 --> 01:02:38.623
You sure are curious.

01:02:38.623 --> 01:02:40.750
Mr. Gold, instead of worrying about that,

01:02:40.750 --> 01:02:45.922
start preparing to regroup the In Goo faction
into the Kang Sik faction, okay?

01:02:45.922 --> 01:02:47.424
Yes!

01:02:47.424 --> 01:02:49.092
I'll get ready.

01:02:49.092 --> 01:02:52.044
- Okay.
- Oh, sir.

01:02:57.142 --> 01:03:00.145
Mr. Gold is quite ambitious.

01:03:00.145 --> 01:03:01.576
Then I'll...

01:03:04.691 --> 01:03:06.725
You'll become the boss soon enough.

01:04:27.774 --> 01:04:30.360
Boss, that hasn't expired yet.

01:04:30.360 --> 01:04:33.071
Oh, I see.

01:04:33.071 --> 01:04:35.439
You're making mistakes
you never used to make.

01:04:36.074 --> 01:04:40.286
Did something happen
regarding that CCTV yesterday?

01:04:44.499 --> 01:04:47.678
Yesterday, I met Jeong Ho Myung.

01:04:49.170 --> 01:04:52.131
J-Jeong Ho Myung?

01:04:52.131 --> 01:04:54.133
Ah, that guy...

01:04:54.133 --> 01:04:56.761
But he knew not only me,

01:04:56.761 --> 01:04:59.296
but you too, Gong Bok.

01:05:01.015 --> 01:05:04.435
Jeong Ho Myung acted like he knew you?

01:05:04.435 --> 01:05:10.149
Yeah, but it's not just recognizing faces.

01:05:10.149 --> 01:05:13.403
He knew all about us. He even knew
why we came to Yeongseondo Island

01:05:13.403 --> 01:05:15.938
ten years ago and what we were here for.

01:05:20.952 --> 01:05:22.704
Boss, I...

01:05:22.704 --> 01:05:25.803
- I have something to tell you.
- Yeah.

01:06:02.280 --> 01:06:04.422
Listen carefully, I'm about to make you

01:06:04.422 --> 01:06:06.428
an offer you can't refuse.

01:06:06.428 --> 01:06:07.912
Boss, you're getting old too.

01:06:07.912 --> 01:06:09.416
You can't do everything alone anymore.

01:06:09.416 --> 01:06:11.080
Fine. I accept your offer.

01:06:11.080 --> 01:06:12.618
- Hey!
- Come on!

01:06:12.618 --> 01:06:14.736
Are you saying Yoo In Goo
got involved with drugs too?

01:06:14.736 --> 01:06:16.040
Let's focus on our deal.

01:06:16.040 --> 01:06:17.730
You don't remember anything?
Not even one bit?

01:06:17.730 --> 01:06:18.792
I don't know.

01:06:18.792 --> 01:06:20.244
Did you figure out who this woman is?

01:06:20.244 --> 01:06:22.760
Mi Kyeong has feelings for me too.

01:06:22.760 --> 01:06:25.128
Should we just throw him in?

01:06:25.128 --> 01:06:26.424
She'd probably tear you apart.

01:06:26.424 --> 01:06:27.592
We're not working under you.

01:06:27.592 --> 01:06:29.608
- The masks, the disguises, it's all over.
- We're going straight through.

01:06:29.608 --> 01:06:30.856
Do you have the confidence
to take them all down?

01:06:30.856 --> 01:06:33.736
If it can't be done,
then we'll make it happen.
